      "statement": "Checkout.validate enforces structured input rules: customerEmail length ≤254 matching an email regex; postalCode matching ^[A-Za-z0-9 -]{3,16}$; 1–100 distinct SKUs with quantities 1–1000 matching ^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,100}$; paymentScenario values success, decline, or timeout; shippingScenario values success or failure.",
