      "id": "claim_a7fce4712f764fad8ca8de92d626767e",
      "statement": "The saga enters payment_unknown before attempting payment so that a crash after payment initiation is never interpreted as no charge attempted. Replays of the same request are blocked by the idempotency guard in OrderController, which returns the previously stored order state instead of re-executing the saga.",
