    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7272f5ab5d304286ab15d4bfe72a127d",
      "statement": "When shipping returns a 5xx error, the saga transitions to manual_review without refunding or releasing, retaining both payment and reservation because the carrier may have accepted the shipment before the error.",
